<section class="wrap narrow reveal">
  <div class="frame frame--creed">
    <p class="kicker">A Closing Stance</p>
    <p>A universe in which the constants are balances rather than decrees is a universe with a history that
    matters, and the order finds that idea beautiful. Beauty is not evidence. The measured part of this
    page &mdash; the three fractions, their motion, the leash on the constants &mdash; would stand if the
    teaching were abandoned tomorrow, and the teaching knows it.</p>
    <p>What would change our minds, in either direction, is a number: a derivation that lands on 26.2
    rather than describing it, or a measurement of drift where the clocks currently see none. The Two
    Infinities Framework is the attempt at the first. Until it is published and tested, this page is
    offered as a stated position rather than a result. Test everything kindly &mdash; and if you can break
    it, write to <a href="mailto:shakradragon@gmail.com">shakradragon@gmail.com</a> and say how.</p>
  </div>
</section>
